{"version":1,"locations":[{"id":"party-roller-rink","pack":"party","category":"active-venues","emoji":"🛼","name":"Roller Rink","fullName":"A Roller Skating Rink","clues":["Someone wearing neon knee pads crashes into a wall of birthday balloons.","Disco music competes with the unmistakable thud of another person falling.","Buttered popcorn mixed with rental footwear that has seen better decades."],"hint":"Somewhere you'll probably fall down","hintEasy":"A place where people circle around and around to music","hintHard":"Somewhere people move around","facts":[{"en":"James Plimpton patented the four-wheel quad roller skate in 1863, making turning on skates much easier."},{"en":"Roller discos became a craze in the late 1970s, mixing skating with disco music and lights."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate a pretzel that fought back.","heat":1},{"text":"I spilled nacho cheese on my knee pads.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate fries beside a wall of rented wheels.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard somebody yell, ‘I’m fine!’","heat":1},{"text":"I heard disco music and a spectacular thud.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard eight wheels rattle over the floor.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a dad pretending he wasn’t scared.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a kid glide backward past his mom.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a guard in stripes whistle at the speedsters.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a bandage for my wounded pride.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a glittery knee pad under a bench.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried boots with four wheels underneath.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my legs filed a complaint.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after my third dramatic floor hug.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the DJ called the final lap.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was near the snack counter, mostly.","heat":1},{"text":"I was under the disco ball, rolling slowly.","heat":2},{"text":"I was in the middle of the rink, on eight wheels.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was trying not to embarrass myself.","heat":1},{"text":"I was falling down with great confidence.","heat":2},{"text":"I was skating backward. For two seconds.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate a hot dog while rolling past it three times.","I tried to order nachos but kept drifting away from the counter."],"sound":["I heard the DJ yell 'reverse!' and everyone collide.","I heard my own wheels squeak like a nervous mouse."],"people":["I saw a grandpa in tube socks lap everyone twice.","I watched a conga line of beginners topple like dominoes."],"object":["I found a lone wheel rolling around with no owner.","I carried rental boots in size 'clown' with orange laces."],"leaving":["I left by crawling to the carpet on my hands and knees.","I left still wobbling, because my legs forgot how floors work."],"where":["I was glued to the wall, doing the scared crab shuffle.","I was stuck spinning in the center during the limbo contest."],"doing":["I was doing the hokey pokey and falling on 'turn around.'","I was flapping my arms like a bird to stay upright."]}},{"id":"party-trampoline-park","pack":"party","category":"active-venues","emoji":"🤸","name":"Trampoline Park","fullName":"An Indoor Trampoline Park","clues":["A father attempts an impressive flip and lands in a mountain of colorful foam cubes.","Excited shrieks, rhythmic squeaking, and an employee repeatedly reminding everyone of the rules.","Rubber flooring, fresh socks, and warm pretzels."],"hint":"Somewhere you'll probably fall down","hintEasy":"A place where kids and adults launch themselves into the air","hintHard":"Somewhere people move around","facts":[{"en":"The word trampoline comes from the Spanish 'trampolín', meaning diving board."},{"en":"George Nissen and Larry Griswold built an early trampoline in the 1930s, and the US Navy later used trampolines to train WWII pilots."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate a cookie that vanished in two bites.","heat":1},{"text":"I drank water like I’d crossed a desert.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate pizza while wearing sticky grip socks.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard a kid shout, ‘Watch this!’","heat":1},{"text":"I heard springs squeak beneath squealing kids.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard a foam-pit landing swallow a scream.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a grown-up lose an argument with gravity.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a kid attempt a very crooked flip.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a staffer in a red shirt patrol the bounce courts.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a sock that wasn’t mine.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a foam cube stuck to my shirt.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried neon grip socks with rubber soles.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my knees requested retirement.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after my last flip became a flop.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when my bouncing wristband expired.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was in line, waiting for my turn.","heat":1},{"text":"I was on a giant bouncy floor, mid-air.","heat":2},{"text":"I was buried up to my neck in foam cubes.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was proving I'm still young. I'm not.","heat":1},{"text":"I was doing a flip. Mostly sideways.","heat":2},{"text":"I was bouncing way too high in grip socks.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate a slice of pizza mid-bounce. Most of it landed.","I lost a gummy bear in the foam and never found it."],"sound":["I heard a dad grunt 'I still got it!' then belly-flop.","I heard forty grip socks squeak at the same time."],"people":["I saw a toddler out-bounce a whole team of teenagers.","I watched a grown man get stuck in the foam like quicksand."],"object":["I carried a foam cube home in my hood by accident.","I found my missing grip sock stuck to the ceiling net."],"leaving":["I left still feeling like the floor was going up and down.","I left after a staffer fished me out of the foam with a pole."],"where":["I was on the dodgeball court, bouncing away from everyone.","I was in the wall-run lane, flopping like a pancake."],"doing":["I was playing dodgeball while airborne. I lost.","I was trying to bounce high enough to high-five the ceiling."]}},{"id":"party-ice-skating-rink","pack":"party","category":"active-venues","emoji":"⛸️","name":"Ice Rink","fullName":"An Ice Skating Rink","clues":["A child glides gracefully past an adult desperately gripping the railing.","Sharp scraping noises echo beneath cheerful music and occasional cries for help.","Cold air, hot chocolate, and damp winter clothing."],"hint":"Somewhere you'll probably fall down","hintEasy":"A cold place where people wear rented boots","hintHard":"Somewhere people move around","facts":[{"en":"The oldest known ice skates were made from animal bones about 5,000 years ago."},{"en":"Frank Zamboni invented the ice resurfacing machine in 1949 in California."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I drank cocoa and burned my tongue.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate soup while my fingers thawed.","heat":2},{"text":"I drank cocoa beside a machine smoothing ice.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone shriek, then laugh.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard sharp blades scraping beneath the music.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard metal runners carve circles into ice.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a child cling to an exhausted dad.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a teenager glide backward in circles.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a coach demonstrate a perfect spin.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried gloves that smelled like wet pennies.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a mitten frozen against the barrier.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried boots with long metal blades.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when I couldn’t feel my toes.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after falling on the same elbow twice.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the ice resurfacer rolled out.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was near the rental counter.","heat":1},{"text":"I was hugging the railing for dear life.","heat":2},{"text":"I was on the ice, dodging the resurfacer.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was trying to look cool. It didn't work.","heat":1},{"text":"I was sliding around on thin blades.","heat":2},{"text":"I was gliding on the ice in rented skates.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I drank cocoa so fast my marshmallows froze in fear.","I ate a pretzel while my rented blades wobbled under the table."],"sound":["I heard the resurfacer hum like a sleepy whale.","I heard my teeth chatter in perfect rhythm with the music."],"people":["I saw a toddler on a plastic penguin pass me with ease.","I watched a figure skater spin until I got dizzy."],"object":["I found a frozen mitten that waved at me from the boards.","I carried a plastic penguin I was too old to need. Mostly."],"leaving":["I left when my nose turned into a tiny popsicle.","I left by sliding to the exit on my belly like a seal."],"where":["I was clinging to a plastic penguin in the middle of the ice.","I was in the penalty box, hiding from the cold."],"doing":["I was doing a spin. Well, the ice was spinning me.","I was skating like a baby deer in mittens."]}},{"id":"party-rock-climbing-gym","pack":"party","category":"active-venues","emoji":"🧗","name":"Climbing Gym","fullName":"An Indoor Rock Climbing Gym","clues":["A teenager hangs sideways from a colorful wall while an instructor watches calmly below.","Shoes scrape against textured surfaces as someone shouts encouragement from the floor.","Chalk dust, rubber shoes, and fresh sports drinks."],"hint":"Somewhere you'll probably fall down","hintEasy":"A place where people go up and hope to come down slowly","hintHard":"Somewhere people move around","facts":[{"en":"One of the first artificial climbing walls was built at the University of Leeds, England, in 1964."},{"en":"Sport climbing made its Olympic debut at the Tokyo 2020 Games, held in 2021."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate a banana like it owed me money.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate a granola bar with chalky fingers.","heat":2},{"text":"I drank water beneath a wall of colored holds.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone yell, ‘Almost there!’","heat":1},{"text":"I heard rubber shoes squeak against the wall.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard a belayer call, ‘Take!’ from below.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a child embarrass three adults.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a woman reach for a tiny red grip.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a belayer manage rope below a climber.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a water bottle covered in dust.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a chalk bag beside the padded floor.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a harness with dangling carabiners.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my arms became spaghetti.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after failing the same yellow route.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when I couldn’t grip another hold.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was near the wall, stretching.","heat":1},{"text":"I was halfway up, refusing to look down.","heat":2},{"text":"I was dangling from a rope over the crash mats.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was pretending I wasn't tired.","heat":1},{"text":"I was chalking my hands for the fifth time.","heat":2},{"text":"I was climbing colorful holds in a harness.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate trail mix that tasted ninety percent chalk.","I ate a banana while hanging from a rope. Bad idea."],"sound":["I heard someone cheer for me from below. I was stuck.","I heard a climber whisper 'please' to a tiny purple hold."],"people":["I saw a kid scurry up the wall like a spider in tights.","I watched a grown-up hug the wall and refuse to let go."],"object":["I carried climbing shoes so tight my toes filed a complaint.","I found a chalk handprint on my face. It wasn't mine."],"leaving":["I left once they lowered me down like a sack of potatoes.","I left with chalky hands that made me look like a ghost."],"where":["I was stuck on the overhang, upside down like a bat.","I was halfway up, clinging to a hold shaped like a pizza."],"doing":["I was naming every hold so they'd be nicer to me.","I was doing the splits on the wall. Not on purpose."]}},{"id":"party-bowling-alley","pack":"party","category":"game-venues","emoji":"🎳","name":"Bowling Alley","fullName":"A Bowling Alley","clues":["A teenager celebrates wildly while the scoreboard displays an embarrassingly low number.","A thunderous crash is followed by cheers from one table and groans from another.","Hot pizza, floor polish, and suspiciously clean rental shoes."],"hint":"Somewhere people compete for fun","hintEasy":"A place where heavy things roll and loud crashes are good news","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend time with friends","facts":[{"en":"A perfect game in bowling scores 300 points: twelve strikes in a row."},{"en":"A standard tenpin bowling pin stands 15 inches tall."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate fries while everyone blamed me.","heat":1},{"text":"I spilled nacho cheese on my rented shoes.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate pizza beside ten stubborn wooden pins.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard a crash followed by applause.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard heavy balls rumbling down wooden lanes.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard all ten pins explode after a strike.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a grandma destroy everyone's confidence.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a kid celebrate knocking down one pin.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a staffer rescue a ball from the gutter.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried something heavier than expected.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a shoe with somebody else's name.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a shiny ball with three finger holes.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my friends started keeping score.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after seven straight gutter balls.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the pinsetter jammed again.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was at a table with my friends.","heat":1},{"text":"I was on lane seven, losing badly.","heat":2},{"text":"I was at the ball return, picking a 12-pounder.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was keeping score. Badly.","heat":1},{"text":"I was doing my victory dance. Too early.","heat":2},{"text":"I was rolling gutter balls in rented shoes.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate fries with my bowling fingers. Big mistake.","I ate pizza while my ball rolled by itself into the gutter."],"sound":["I heard my ball bounce twice before it even rolled.","I heard the gutter bumpers come up just for me."],"people":["I saw a toddler use a ramp and bowl a strike.","I watched a dad do the splits while releasing the ball."],"object":["I carried a ball so heavy it carried me instead.","I found the shoe spray and sprayed my sandwich by accident."],"leaving":["I left still wearing the striped shoes. Oops.","I left after my ball got stuck in the return machine."],"where":["I was on the lane, sliding past the line on my socks.","I was at the scoring screen, picking a silly nickname."],"doing":["I was bowling granny-style between my legs.","I was making the pins fall by yelling at them. Didn't work."]}},{"id":"party-mini-golf","pack":"party","category":"game-venues","emoji":"⛳","name":"Mini Golf","fullName":"A Miniature Golf Course","clues":["A tiny plastic windmill blocks the path of a bright orange ball.","A gentle tap is followed by someone accusing a decorative dinosaur of cheating.","Freshly trimmed grass, damp concrete, and nearby ice cream cones."],"hint":"Somewhere people compete for fun","hintEasy":"An outdoor place with tiny obstacles and colorful balls","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend time with friends","facts":[{"en":"One of the first mini golf courses, 'Tom Thumb Golf', opened on Lookout Mountain, Tennessee, in 1927."},{"en":"During the 1930s mini golf craze, thousands of courses opened across the United States."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate candy while plotting my comeback.","heat":1},{"text":"I dropped popcorn beside a tiny waterfall.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate a hot dog near the spinning windmill.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone yell, 'That doesn't count!'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard a little ball rattle inside a tunnel.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard my ball bounce off a plastic castle.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I watched a child defeat three adults.","heat":1},{"text":"I saw a couple argue over a crooked shot.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a kid putt beneath a giant windmill.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a pencil with no eraser.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a bright orange ball in the bushes.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a tiny putter and a scorecard.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left after losing to a seven-year-old.","heat":1},{"text":"I left when my ball vanished into the pond.","heat":2},{"text":"I left after the final hole swallowed my ball.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was outside, near the entrance.","heat":1},{"text":"I was stuck on hole nine for ten minutes.","heat":2},{"text":"I was next to the windmill, losing to it.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was keeping score with a tiny pencil.","heat":1},{"text":"I was arguing about a do-over.","heat":2},{"text":"I was putting a neon ball past a fake dinosaur.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate ice cream while my ball sank into the fake pond.","I traded a cookie for one free do-over. It was worth it."],"sound":["I heard my ball splash into a tiny moat.","I heard the windmill blades thwack my ball back at me."],"people":["I saw a grandpa sink a hole-in-one and run a victory lap.","I watched a kid wade into the pond to rescue a ball."],"object":["I carried a putter so short I had to crouch to swing it.","I found six lost balls inside a fake shark's mouth."],"leaving":["I left after giving my score a 'creative' adjustment.","I left when the clown mouth hole ate my last ball."],"where":["I was on the hole with the pirate ship, losing to a cannon.","I was crouched by a fake volcano, aiming between its legs."],"doing":["I was arguing with a windmill about timing.","I was putting with my eyes closed for good luck."]}},{"id":"party-laser-tag","pack":"party","category":"game-venues","emoji":"🔫","name":"Laser Tag","fullName":"A Laser Tag Arena","clues":["Glowing red and blue vests dart between futuristic barriers in a dark maze.","Electronic blasts, dramatic battle music, and someone yelling that their equipment is broken.","Artificial fog, plastic equipment, and warm carpet."],"hint":"Somewhere people compete for fun","hintEasy":"A dark place where teams sneak around wearing glowing gear","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend time with friends","facts":[{"en":"The first laser tag arena, Photon, opened in Dallas, Texas, in 1984."},{"en":"Most laser tag guns don't use lasers at all: they fire invisible infrared light."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate chips while planning revenge.","heat":1},{"text":"I drank water beneath glowing purple lights.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate pizza after returning my glowing vest.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard somebody scream, 'Behind you!'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard electronic blasts echo in the dark.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard my sensor beep after another hit.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a quiet kid become terrifying.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a teenager hide behind a glowing wall.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a staffer adjust someone's flashing vest.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried something that made me feel powerful.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a glowing wristband behind a barrier.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a plastic blaster with a red sensor.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my team stopped trusting me.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after hiding in the same corner twice.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the arena lights came back on.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was somewhere dark.","heat":1},{"text":"I was hiding behind a glowing wall.","heat":2},{"text":"I was crouched in the maze in a light-up vest.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was running around a lot.","heat":1},{"text":"I was ambushing my best friend. No regrets.","heat":2},{"text":"I was firing a laser at the red team.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate pizza while my vest still beeped at me.","I chugged juice to recover from getting tagged 47 times."],"sound":["I heard a robot voice say 'you have been tagged' again.","I heard my teammate hum spy music while sneaking."],"people":["I saw a grandma climb the ramp and tag everyone.","I watched a kid in a glowing vest do a dramatic dive roll."],"object":["I carried a vest that blinked so much it gave me away.","I found my own scorecard. I came in last, by a lot."],"leaving":["I left when my vest ran out of lives before I did.","I left after accidentally tagging my own teammate. Twice."],"where":["I was hiding in the fog, glowing like a nightlight.","I was on the upper ramp, doing spy rolls between walls."],"doing":["I was crawling on my belly like a secret agent.","I was guarding our base with a glowing blaster."]}},{"id":"party-arcade","pack":"party","category":"game-venues","emoji":"🕹️","name":"Arcade","fullName":"A Retro Video Game Arcade","clues":["Rows of flashing cabinets surround a child proudly holding an enormous pile of paper tickets.","Electronic jingles, rapid button tapping, and the triumphant scream of someone winning a stuffed banana.","Warm electronics, sugary drinks, and buttery popcorn."],"hint":"Somewhere people compete for fun","hintEasy":"A noisy place full of blinking screens and prize tickets","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend time with friends","facts":[{"en":"Atari's Pong, released in 1972, was one of the first hit arcade video games."},{"en":"Pac-Man was originally released in Japan as 'Puck-Man'."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate candy and regretted sharing.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate fries beneath a thousand blinking lights.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate pizza beside a mountain of prize tickets.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard somebody shout, 'One more try!'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard electronic jingles fighting for attention.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard coins drop and a jackpot siren wail.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a child negotiate like a lawyer.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a teenager defeat a dancing machine.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a kid trade 900 tickets for a pencil.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a plastic dinosaur with one eye.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a forgotten token beneath a machine.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a card loaded with game credits.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my wallet surrendered.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after losing to the claw machine again.","heat":2},{"text":"I left with 400 tickets and a rubber spider.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was by the snack machines.","heat":1},{"text":"I was in a corner full of flashing lights.","heat":2},{"text":"I was at the prize counter with too few tickets.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was playing a few games.","heat":1},{"text":"I was mashing buttons and losing to a kid.","heat":2},{"text":"I was feeding tokens into a claw machine.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate gummy bears while waiting for a turn on the pinball.","I spent my snack money on tokens and ate one mint."],"sound":["I heard a pinball machine say 'extra ball!' just for me.","I heard the skee-ball lanes clack like angry woodpeckers."],"people":["I saw a grandpa beat the high score on a cabinet from 1983.","I watched a kid hug the claw machine after it finally won."],"object":["I carried a ribbon of tickets longer than my body.","I found a stuffed alien dangling from the claw, stuck."],"leaving":["I left with a plastic spider ring and a broken heart.","I left wearing my prize-ticket strip as a scarf."],"where":["I was at the skee-ball lanes, aiming for the tiny hole.","I was jammed inside a racing seat, steering wildly."],"doing":["I was dancing on a light-up floor and missing every arrow.","I was whacking moles that were faster than me."]}},{"id":"party-escape-room","pack":"party","category":"game-venues","emoji":"🔐","name":"Escape Room","fullName":"An Escape Room","clues":["Four adults argue over a mysterious wooden box while a giant countdown glows red.","A mechanical click interrupts someone shouting that they have solved everything.","Dusty furniture, artificial fog, and somebody's stress-induced perspiration."],"hint":"Somewhere people compete for fun","hintEasy":"A place where a group races the clock to get out","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend time with friends","facts":[{"en":"The first live escape room game is usually credited to SCRAP in Kyoto, Japan, in 2007."},{"en":"Many escape rooms give teams 60 minutes to solve the puzzles and get out."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate a cookie while blaming my teammates.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate candy after solving a stubborn riddle.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate pizza after our locked-door countdown ended.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone whisper, 'Don't touch that.'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard a hidden latch click behind a painting.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard the final countdown over a locked door.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw my smartest friend panic over a number.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a teammate inspect every fake book.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw our game master offer a cryptic clue.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a key that opened absolutely nothing.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a coded message beneath a loose tile.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a four-digit lock and a cipher wheel.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when everyone blamed my math.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after our final clue made no sense.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the game master ended our timer.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was in a small themed room.","heat":1},{"text":"I was by the door that wouldn't open.","heat":2},{"text":"I was next to the giant countdown clock.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was solving a puzzle. Allegedly.","heat":1},{"text":"I was yelling 'try 1-2-3-4!' at everyone.","heat":2},{"text":"I was hunting for the key to a locked box.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate a mint I found in a drawer. It wasn't a clue.","I ate a cookie while yelling numbers at a padlock."],"sound":["I heard a secret bookshelf creak open by itself.","I heard a voice say 'ten minutes left' and we all screamed."],"people":["I saw my friend try to unlock the door with a banana.","I watched a teammate shake a teddy bear for clues."],"object":["I carried a black light that showed spots on everything.","I found a map that was really just a pizza menu."],"leaving":["I left after we used three hints and still needed four.","I left once we found the exit key in my own pocket."],"where":["I was inside a fake wardrobe looking for a secret door.","I was under the desk, reading clues with a flashlight."],"doing":["I was trying every key on every lock, one at a time.","I was reading a riddle backward to see if it helped."]}},{"id":"party-karaoke-bar","pack":"party","category":"show-venues","emoji":"🎤","name":"Karaoke Bar","fullName":"A Karaoke Bar","clues":["A nervous man grips a microphone while his friends wave glowing plastic sticks.","Someone confidently performs an entire chorus in the wrong key.","Fried appetizers, spilled soda, and an aggressively floral air freshener."],"hint":"Somewhere with an audience","hintEasy":"A place where ordinary people grab the spotlight","hintHard":"Somewhere people gather for an experience","facts":[{"en":"'Karaoke' is Japanese for 'empty orchestra': the music plays without a singer."},{"en":"Daisuke Inoue built an early karaoke machine in Japan in 1971 and never patented it."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate fries to avoid answering questions.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate nachos while my friend butchered a chorus.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate wings beside a screen full of song lyrics.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard a note that frightened the furniture.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard a crowd rescue a forgotten chorus.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard a microphone squeal between two songs.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw my shy friend become a superstar.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a couple argue over a duet.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw the host hand a microphone to a stranger.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a napkin covered in nervous scribbles.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a song-request slip beneath my chair.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a wireless microphone onto the stage.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my confidence ran out.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after my duet partner forgot every word.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the host announced the final song.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was at a table near the back.","heat":1},{"text":"I was right next to the speakers.","heat":2},{"text":"I was on the tiny stage holding the mic.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was having a drink with friends.","heat":1},{"text":"I was cheering for someone very off-key.","heat":2},{"text":"I was belting a power ballad off a screen.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate mozzarella sticks between verses of a love ballad.","I ate nachos while waiting forty songs for my turn."],"sound":["I heard a tambourine played completely out of rhythm.","I heard someone sing the instrumental part too."],"people":["I saw a grandma rap every word faster than the screen.","I watched a group sing a boy band song with dance moves."],"object":["I carried a tambourine I wasn't supposed to take.","I found the song book open to 'national anthems.'"],"leaving":["I left after the host kindly unplugged my microphone.","I left once my voice cracked into a dolphin squeak."],"where":["I was under the spotlight, reading lyrics I didn't know.","I was in the booth, flipping through the song binder."],"doing":["I was dramatically kneeling during the high note.","I was singing backup with a breadstick for a mic."]}},{"id":"party-comedy-club","pack":"party","category":"show-venues","emoji":"🎙️","name":"Comedy Club","fullName":"A Stand-Up Comedy Club","clues":["A single spotlight illuminates a nervous performer while the front row avoids eye contact.","A room erupts in laughter, followed by an uncomfortable silence after a terrible joke.","Fresh nachos, citrus soda, and a little too much cologne."],"hint":"Somewhere with an audience","hintEasy":"A place where the crowd is supposed to laugh on cue","hintHard":"Somewhere people gather for an experience","facts":[{"en":"The Comedy Store, one of the most famous comedy clubs, opened in Los Angeles in 1972."},{"en":"Many comedians test new jokes at small 'open mic' nights before using them in big shows."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate fries while pretending to understand.","heat":1},{"text":"I choked on popcorn during an awkward punchline.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate nachos beneath a tiny brick-wall stage.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard one person laugh three seconds late.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard nervous laughter after a terrible joke.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard a microphone drop after the final punchline.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a man regret sitting in front.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a performer roast someone's haircut.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw the emcee introduce a nervous stand-up act.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a napkin covered in bad ideas.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a crumpled set list near the stage.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a crumpled ticket that said 'Front Row'.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left before somebody noticed my face.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after becoming the punchline twice.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the final comedian dropped the mic.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was sitting in the dark.","heat":1},{"text":"I was at a tiny table near the wall.","heat":2},{"text":"I was in the front row. Big mistake.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was laughing politely.","heat":1},{"text":"I was trying not to make eye contact.","heat":2},{"text":"I was getting roasted by the comedian.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate pretzels to hide my laugh during the sad part.","I spilled soda when the comedian asked my name."],"sound":["I heard a joke so bad even the drummer groaned.","I heard the crowd clap two drinks after the punchline."],"people":["I saw a comedian forget the joke and blame the spotlight.","I watched a stand-up do a whole act about my shoes."],"object":["I carried a rubber chicken someone tossed toward the stage.","I found a joke written on a napkin. It wasn't funny."],"leaving":["I left after the comedian nicknamed me 'Sweater Guy.'","I left during the applause so nobody could ask my name."],"where":["I was in the second row, ducking every time the mic turned.","I was behind a pillar, laughing at nothing I could see."],"doing":["I was heckling. Politely. With a compliment.","I was explaining the joke to my friend during the next one."]}},{"id":"party-haunted-house","pack":"party","category":"show-venues","emoji":"👻","name":"Haunted House","fullName":"A Haunted House Attraction","clues":["A crooked portrait appears to follow visitors with its eyes while a plastic skeleton hangs from the ceiling.","A sudden scream is followed by someone insisting they were not frightened.","Artificial fog, dusty curtains, and cinnamon from a nearby snack stand."],"hint":"Somewhere with an audience","hintEasy":"A dark place where strangers jump out at you on purpose","hintHard":"Somewhere people gather for an experience","facts":[{"en":"Disneyland's Haunted Mansion opened in 1969."},{"en":"Haunted attractions often hire 'scare actors' whose whole job is to make visitors jump."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate candy to recover my dignity.","heat":1},{"text":"I dropped my popcorn when something grabbed me.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate gummy worms beside a fake spider the size of a cat.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone scream louder than me.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard chains dragging behind a dark curtain.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard a fake chainsaw roar beside a coffin.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a teenager hide behind his little sister.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a masked actor crawl from the shadows.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a zombie performer chase our entire group.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a flashlight with dying batteries.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a plastic bone beneath a curtain.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a rubber skull past a fake grave.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my courage abandoned me.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after a masked stranger jumped out.","heat":2},{"text":"I left through the emergency exit by the coffins.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was somewhere very dark.","heat":1},{"text":"I was in a hallway full of fake cobwebs.","heat":2},{"text":"I was behind my friend, next to a fake coffin.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was walking very slowly.","heat":1},{"text":"I was screaming and pretending I wasn't.","heat":2},{"text":"I was running from a guy with a chainsaw.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate eyeball gumballs while hiding behind my friend.","I threw my candy at a ghost. It said 'thanks.'"],"sound":["I heard a creaky door, then my own scream, then a giggle.","I heard an organ play spooky music, slightly off-key."],"people":["I saw a zombie actor ask if I was okay. I wasn't.","I watched a vampire trip on his own cape."],"object":["I carried a glow stick like it was a magic sword.","I found a fake cobweb tangled in my hair all night."],"leaving":["I left by running backward so nothing could follow me.","I left holding hands with a stranger who was also scared."],"where":["I was in the mirror maze, scared of my own reflection.","I was stuck in a pitch-black hallway that kept wiggling."],"doing":["I was apologizing to every skeleton I bumped into.","I was screaming at a mannequin that didn't even move."]}},{"id":"party-magic-show","pack":"party","category":"show-venues","emoji":"🎩","name":"Magic Show","fullName":"A Live Magic Show","clues":["A volunteer stares suspiciously at an empty hat while the performer smiles confidently.","Dramatic music builds before the audience gasps at something nobody can explain.","Velvet curtains, stage makeup, and freshly popped corn."],"hint":"Somewhere with an audience","hintEasy":"A place where things vanish and nobody calls the police","hintHard":"Somewhere people gather for an experience","facts":[{"en":"Harry Houdini, the famous escape artist, was born Erik Weisz in Budapest in 1874."},{"en":"The magic word 'abracadabra' dates back to ancient Rome, where it was written on charms."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate popcorn while questioning reality.","heat":1},{"text":"I spilled soda when something vanished.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate candy as a rabbit emerged from a hat.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard a gasp followed by suspicious applause.","heat":1},{"text":"I heard a drumroll before an empty box opened.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard the crowd gasp at a floating assistant.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a volunteer regret raising his hand.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a performer make someone's watch vanish.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a magician pull silk scarves from thin air.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a card I wasn't allowed to show.","heat":1},{"text":"I found a silk scarf beneath the front row.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a signed playing card from a trick.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my brain demanded an explanation.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after the performer guessed my secret card.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the magician vanished behind a curtain.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was in a seat in the middle.","heat":1},{"text":"I was close enough to see up the sleeves.","heat":2},{"text":"I was on stage as the volunteer.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was clapping a lot.","heat":1},{"text":"I was trying to figure out the trick.","heat":2},{"text":"I was picking a card. Any card.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate popcorn, then the magician pulled one from my ear.","I offered my candy to the rabbit. It said no."],"sound":["I heard a rabbit sneeze from inside a top hat.","I heard a wand go 'boing' and wilt into a fake flower."],"people":["I saw a volunteer get sawed in half and wave both halves.","I watched a dove fly out of a hat and land on my head."],"object":["I carried a string of scarves that never ended.","I found a deck where every card was the queen of hearts."],"leaving":["I left still checking my ears for hidden coins.","I left, but my watch stayed on stage somehow."],"where":["I was inside the disappearing box. It was dusty.","I was in the front row getting confetti from a wand."],"doing":["I was saying 'abracadabra' at my sandwich. Nothing.","I was trying to see the rabbit's secret door."]}},{"id":"party-all-you-can-eat-buffet","pack":"party","category":"food-venues","emoji":"🍽️","name":"The Buffet","fullName":"An All-You-Can-Eat Buffet","clues":["A man balances an impossible mountain of mashed potatoes, noodles, and three desserts on a single plate.","Metal serving spoons clatter against trays while someone announces they're going back for a fourth round.","Roasted chicken, warm bread, and approximately twelve different cuisines competing for attention."],"hint":"Somewhere people go when they're hungry","hintEasy":"A place where taking too much is practically a tradition","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend money and socialize","facts":[{"en":"The word buffet comes from French, where it originally meant a sideboard for serving food."},{"en":"Las Vegas casinos helped popularize the all-you-can-eat buffet in the 1940s."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate dessert before anyone noticed.","heat":1},{"text":"I stacked three desserts beside my mashed potatoes.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate shrimp from the fourth serving station.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone whisper, 'Just one more.'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard serving tongs clatter against metal trays.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard plates stack beside the endless food line.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a grandpa make a questionable decision.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a kid carry a mountain of desserts.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw a staffer refill the empty carving station.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried something heavier than expected.","heat":1},{"text":"I carried a plate with six different desserts.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried a fresh plate back for my third helping.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my stomach requested mercy.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after promising not to get fourths.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when they cleared the last serving station.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was at a big table near the window.","heat":1},{"text":"I was in the dessert line. Again.","heat":2},{"text":"I was guarding the chocolate fountain.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was eating. A lot.","heat":1},{"text":"I was loosening my belt between plates.","heat":2},{"text":"I was going back for my fifth plate.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I made a sandwich using two waffles and a slice of lasagna.","I ate soup, tacos, and pudding off one plate in one trip."],"sound":["I heard a sneeze guard squeak as a man leaned under it.","I heard my plate groan under the weight of nine dinner rolls."],"people":["I saw a man build a castle out of crab legs.","I watched a toddler eat only croutons, five plates' worth."],"object":["I carried a plate so full it needed a second plate.","I carried a dinner roll in each pocket for later."],"leaving":["I left rolling slightly, like a happy bowling ball.","I left when the staff started learning my name."],"where":["I was camped beside the endless mac and cheese tray.","I was at the soft-serve machine, building a tower."],"doing":["I was planning my plate like a chess grandmaster.","I was wearing stretchy pants for scientific reasons."]}},{"id":"party-fancy-re