oor.","heat":2},{"text":"I was at a white tablecloth with six forks.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was on my best behavior.","heat":1},{"text":"I was pretending to understand the wine list.","heat":2},{"text":"I was waiting for course nine of twelve.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate a foam that tasted like a cloud's opinion of carrot.","I ate one pea, served on a plate the size of a hubcap."],"sound":["I heard a waiter describe a cracker's entire childhood.","I heard a man say 'mmm, notes of moss' with a straight face."],"people":["I saw a waiter sweep crumbs with a tiny silver comb.","I watched a man sniff his water like it was perfume."],"object":["I found my napkin folded into a swan while I was gone.","I held a fork so heavy it needed two hands."],"leaving":["I left hungry and bought a hot dog on the way home.","I left after accidentally clapping for the soup."],"where":["I was at a table where someone pulled out my chair.","I was seated so close to the chef I could hear him sigh."],"doing":["I was trying to cut a single pea with a steak knife.","I was pretending the butter sculpture was too pretty to eat."]}},{"id":"party-food-truck-festival","pack":"party","category":"food-venues","emoji":"🚚","name":"Food Truck Festival","fullName":"A Food Truck Festival","clues":["A dozen colorful vehicles line a parking lot while a man struggles to carry tacos, fries, and an enormous lemonade.","Generators hum beneath cheerful conversations and someone shouting that order number forty-seven is ready.","Grilled onions, smoky barbecue, and freshly fried dough drift through the afternoon air."],"hint":"Somewhere people go when they're hungry","hintEasy":"A place where choosing what to eat involves a lot of walking","hintHard":"Somewhere people spend money and socialize","facts":[{"en":"Rancher Charles Goodnight created the chuck wagon in 1866 to feed cowboys on cattle drives."},{"en":"Modern gourmet food trucks took off in Los Angeles around 2008, led by Kogi BBQ's Korean tacos."}],"cards":{"food":[{"text":"I ate something messy with both hands.","heat":1},{"text":"I ate tacos while standing beside a smoky grill.","heat":2},{"text":"I ate loaded fries from a brightly painted truck.","heat":3}],"sound":[{"text":"I heard someone shout, 'Order up!'","heat":1},{"text":"I heard generators humming beneath live music.","heat":2},{"text":"I heard five truck kitchens calling order numbers.","heat":3}],"people":[{"text":"I saw a kid wearing more sauce than shirt.","heat":1},{"text":"I watched a cook flip tortillas through a window.","heat":2},{"text":"I saw families queue between rows of mobile kitchens.","heat":3}],"object":[{"text":"I carried a napkin that surrendered immediately.","heat":1},{"text":"I carried three cardboard trays stacked together.","heat":2},{"text":"I carried numbered tickets from two different trucks.","heat":3}],"leaving":[{"text":"I left when my shirt became a menu.","heat":1},{"text":"I left after standing in my fourth food line.","heat":2},{"text":"I left when the last truck closed its serving window.","heat":3}],"where":[{"text":"I was outside, near a parking lot.","heat":1},{"text":"I was in a line that went around the block.","heat":2},{"text":"I was between a taco truck and a crêpe van.","heat":3}],"doing":[{"text":"I was trying a bit of everything.","heat":1},{"text":"I was juggling three plates and a lemonade.","heat":2},{"text":"I was ordering through a truck window.","heat":3}]},"jokers":{"food":["I ate a taco wrapped in a pancake wrapped in a pizza.","I ate fried dough while waiting in line for more fried dough."],"sound":["I heard a serving window slide open like a tiny stage curtain.","I heard a generator and a guitar compete for loudest."],"people":["I saw a man order lunch from a truck painted like a lobster.","I watched a chef wave a spatula like a conductor's baton."],"object":["I carried a lemonade the size of a fire extinguisher.","I carried a buzzer that shook my fries off the tray."],"leaving":["